{{Quote|Sluis sector was all but empty. A few settled worlds, but none that seemed like a good candidate to hide a Jedi Master.|[[The Archivist]]|<ref name="Crimson Reign 3">[[Crimson Reign 3|''Crimson Reign'' 3]]</ref>}}
The '''Sluis sector''' was a [[sector]] of [[Outer Rim Territories]]. It contained the [[Dagobah system]]<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" />, [[Denab system]],<ref name="Encyclopedia 2024">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> and a few settled [[Planet|worlds]].<ref name="Crimson Reign 3" />

